        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244-a5">

                <pb facs="1000" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Office of the Sheriff of Cochise County</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Tombstone, Ariz</hi></placeName>., <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1907-04-03"><hi rendition="#italic">April 3,
                                1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph H.
                        Kibbey</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Governor of Arizona, Phoenix,
                        Ariz</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    receipt of your letter of March 30, relative to the alleged smuggling of
                    firearms and ammunition to the Yaqui Indians of Mexico. I will notify all
                    dealers of the law, and will also direct my deputies to cooperate with the
                    Arizona Rangers to detect and prevent this business.</p>
                <p>Yours, very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John F. White</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Sheriff.</hi></signed><lb/>By <signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">A. H. Hopkins</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Undersheriff.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
